    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ThrowDown\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar yet unique tower defense game with a randomly-generated map, reactive mobs, and designed for replayability.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ThrowDown takes the classic tower defense gameplay and pairs it with modern features that ensure every playthrough is a fresh challenge. Deploy your defenses strategically as you face endless new maps, diverse enemy waves, and intelligent mobs that will test your tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ThrowDown is designed to keep you coming back for more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers new maps, wave compositions, and strategic possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels cater to both casual gamer and hardcore tower defense veterans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the length of the path to play shorter or longer maps for a fresh challenge</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each game by rolling randomly-generated maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place towers in preparation for game start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your strategy as mobs swarm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and optimize your towers as challenges intensify</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge victorious or fall to the evolving enemy threat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play again with a completely new experience</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ThrowDown\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar yet unique tower defense game with a randomly-generated map, reactive mobs, and designed for replayability.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ThrowDown takes the classic tower defense gameplay and pairs it with modern features that ensure every playthrough is a fresh challenge. Deploy your defenses strategically as you face endless new maps, diverse enemy waves, and intelligent mobs that will test your tactics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ThrowDown is designed to keep you coming back for more:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers new maps, wave compositions, and strategic possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels cater to both casual gamer and hardcore tower defense veterans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the length of the path to play shorter or longer maps for a fresh challenge</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Loop</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start each game by rolling randomly-generated maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place towers in preparation for game start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your strategy as mobs swarm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and optimize your towers as challenges intensify</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge victorious or fall to the evolving enemy threat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play again with a completely new experience</p></li></ul>",
